[signal arg="DialogueBegins"]
OmniChar (Neutral): Hello WORLD!
OmniChar: What's your name?
[text_input var="PlayerName"]
OmniChar: Hello {PlayerName}. How are you?
- Good
	OmniChar (Happy): Thats good to hear!
- Bad
	OmniChar (Sad): Oh no! I hope your day gets better.
OmniChar (Neutral): Welcome to the demo! Let me tell you a secret!
OmniChar: If you press "Esc" while playing the game, you can go back to the main menu.
OmniChar: You can also press "R" to reset the current scene.
OmniChar: Would you like to know more?
- Yes
	OmniChar: If you press "Z" or "X", you can increase or decrease Health by 1.
	OmniChar: You can also refill magic with "C".
	OmniChar: Lastly, you can open and close your inventory with "I".
- No
	OmniChar (Happy): Ok then! I hope you enjoy the Demo.
	[signal arg="DialogueEnds"]
	[end_timeline]
OmniChar (Happy): Thats everything I have for now, I hope you have fun \:)
[signal arg="DialogueEnds"]
